{"1698820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OnSlaught", "steam_appid": 1698820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/b83bbc04aaf91314080848ef2a7a97a5.avif?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/72615285e6b58aab3cb3f50fc2855d3d.webp?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in space and an entire alien civilization wants you dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll face many enemies, each demanding a unique weapon and strategy to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight flesh abominations, fly through black holes, and rip through fleets of alien ships.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/72615285e6b58aab3cb3f50fc2855d3d.webp?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.poster.avif?t=1785987498\" width=559 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.webm?t=1785987498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/982119a29fae486604c4bfde9b90965f.avif?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/72615285e6b58aab3cb3f50fc2855d3d.webp?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every asteroid in OnSlaught is fully destructible. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your grappling hook to fling barrels, asteroids, and space junk at you enemies alongside your 9 other weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/72615285e6b58aab3cb3f50fc2855d3d.webp?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/4d95446a1c95041ff7e86cf9132e6506.poster.avif?t=1785987498\" width=606 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/4d95446a1c95041ff7e86cf9132e6506.webm?t=1785987498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/6c824806281a41721276817dd143d129.avif?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/72615285e6b58aab3cb3f50fc2855d3d.webp?t=1785987498\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph